{"id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-bounded-quantifier.md","title":"Bounded Quantifier","display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","aliases":["92-df-bounded-quantifier"],"display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-bounded-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-bounded-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (bounded variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\)</span> (the bound must not depend on the variable being bounded)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G\\)</span> (definition-target deterministic fresh-variable selector)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;x&lt;t\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\;\n\\bigl(x+S(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t))=t\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\forall x\\,(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;(\\exists x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists x\\,(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;x&lt;t\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\;\n\\bigl(x+S(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t))=t\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\forall x\\,(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;(\\exists x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists x\\,(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x &lt; t\">\\(\\forall x &lt; t\\)</span> : 有界全称量词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x &lt; t\">\\(\\exists x &lt; t\\)</span> : 有界存在量词</li>\n<li>有界量词限制变量范围</li>\n<li>条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\)</span> 保证界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 不随被量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 改变；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G\\)</span> 从无限变量表中确定性地选择未出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 中的内部见证变量</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式：只使用有界量词</li>\n<li>有界量词公式是原始递归可判定的</li>\n<li>用于定义算术层级</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (bounded variable, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n&x<t\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t)\\;\n\\bigl(x+S(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(x,t))=t\\bigr),\\\\\n&(\\forall x<t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\forall x\\,(x<t\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n&(\\exists x<t)\\,\\varphi\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\exists x\\,(x<t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x < t","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x < t","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false}],"bytes":1720,"backlinks":[{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ae2aea0052d422dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md